# Route: guide 46 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Skyborne
# (1291 of 1301 eligible quests, 161.8 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 58 to
# 60, 69 quests, 3.2 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Azshara, Undercity, Orgrimmar, Eastern Plaguelands, Tirisfal Glades,
# Western Plaguelands): Shadowsong Shrine -> Valormok -> The Shattered Strand
# -> Southridge Beach -> Temple of Arkkoran -> Thalassian Base Camp -> Temple
# of Arkkoran -> Southridge Beach -> Valormok -> The Ruined Reaches ->
# Ravencrest Monument -> Undercity -> near Undercity -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): The Name of the Beast (3510;
# Hetaera 55); The Star, the Hand and the Heart (736; Grel'borg the Miser 39,
# Dagun the Ravenous 43, Mogh the Undying 44); The Crimson Courier (6145;
# Crimson Courier 60); Shadowshard Fragments (7068; Shadowshard Rumbler 40-41,
# Shadowshard Smasher 41-42, Shadowshard Thunderer 38); The Scarlet Oracle,
# Demetria (6148; Demetria 61).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): The Book of Ur (1013), The Book of Ur (1013), Going,
# Going, Guano! (1109), Going, Going, Guano! (1109), Bring the End (3341), The
# Power to Destroy... (5725), Light's Justice (92421), Light's Justice
# (92421), The New Plague (95216), Source of Power (96988), Necklace Recovery,
# Take 2 (2284), Rig Wars (2841), Rig Wars (2841), The Royal Rescue (4003),
# For The Horde! (4974), Returning the Lost Satchel (5724), Hidden Enemies
# (5728), Hidden Enemies (5728), Slaying the Beast (5761), Slaying the Beast
# (5761), Changing Tastes (95697), Changing Tastes (95697), Dawn's Gambit
# (4771), The Flesh Does Not Lie (5212), The Active Agent (5213), The Great
# Fras Siabi (5214), Houses of the Holy (5243), The Archivist (5251), Above
# and Beyond (5263), The Restless Souls (5282), Menethil's Gift (5463),
# Plagued Hatchlings (5529), Ramstein (6163), Dead Man's Plea (8945),
# Anthion's Old Friend (8948), Vorrel's Revenge (1051), Barov Family Fortune
# (5341), The Wrath of Rath'mael (92422), The Wrath of Rath'mael (92422),
# Crest of Lordaeron (95204), Unending Torment (97288), Doctor Theolen
# Krastinov, the Butcher (5382), Kirtonos the Herald (5384), The Lich, Ras
# Frostwhisper (5466), Krastinov's Bag of Horrors (5515), Of Love and Family
# (5848), Oculus Illusions (6569).

